:: Fishing Forest Lake Rock Slip
As you shift your weight, you begin to slip on the wet rocks.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Rock Slip Check]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Rock Slip Check
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty 600 1200>><</silently>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You manage to catch yourself, regaining your footing on the slick rock.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<span class="red">You tumble into the lake.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Lake Depths]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
